I have not come to abolish any law or prophecy. I have not come to take away anything from them, but to complete them.
I am not a mere alleged person telling you this as a fact. For heaven and earth will pass away before the smallest point of the law is made invalid. And not the smallest detail of the law will be made invalid before the whole book is completed.
